### ==========================================
### Practical 05: Express.js CRUD API Tests
### ==========================================

### 1. Server Welcome & Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### 3. Filter Products by Category (Electronics)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=Electronics

### 4. Search Products by Name Keyword (Mouse)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?search=Mouse

### 5. Get Single Product by ID (ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/1

### 6. Get Non-Existing Product (Test 404 response)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/999

### 7. Create New Product (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ultra-Wide Gaming Monitor 34-inch",
  "category": "Displays",
  "price": 38999,
  "stock": 12
}

### 8. Test Validation Error on Create (Missing Price)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Product Item"
}

### 9. Update Existing Product (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB (Updated Pro Edition)",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 3999,
  "stock": 30,
  "inStock": true
}

### 10. Delete Product by ID (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/products/2
